WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.210
Have you ever wondered what SCP-590,Thomas
Jack Bright, wants more than anything?

00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:10.500
Foundation staff used SCP-978, The Desire
Camera, to snap a picture of TJ while he was

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.880
playing with blocks.

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.740
This was the result:

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:18.400
"SCP-590's face is close up to the camera,
filling the entire photo.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.510
His hands are displayed as if pressed against
the lens.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:24.890
His mouth is open, and tears fill his eyes."

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:31.380
A truly harrowing cry for help that reveals
the pain behind SCP-590's calm exterior.

